+## Wand VS Code shortcuts
+
+- Only the wand home HUD gains Review changes and Stage files immediately to the right of Switch App, in that order, while VS Code is frontmost. Keep the normal mice and app-specific navigation unchanged.
+- Hold Middle on either shortcut; initial vertical travel then circular continuation produces existing review wheel steps. Release finishes the same Better Git session. Preserve cancellation on stale input, hidden HUD or app changes.
